<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pennzoil cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pennzoil cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it downgraded Pennzoil Co to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, Union Pacific Resources Group Inc launched an unsolicited tender offer for Pennzoil. The deal was valued at about $6.4 billion.</p>
<p>-- Pennzoil lost 1/8 to 77-3/8.</p>
</text>
